OL,3,GNEWSACouncil data blunder reveals email
OL,4,Aaddresses
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council's data protection blunder
OL,7,Fthat revealed hundreds of email
OL,8,Faddresses has been blamed on "human
OL,9,Ferror".
OL,11,FLabour-led Stockton Council failed to
OL,12,Fuse the Bcc function on a mass email
OL,13,Fabout consultation events, with one
OL,14,Frecipient telling the Local Democracy
OL,15,FReporting Service about 250 addresses
OL,16,Fwere viewable.
OL,18,FA spokesperson for the authority said
OL,19,Fthe foul-up had been "referred to the
OL,20,Fcouncil's data protection officer for
OL,21,Ffurther investigation".
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
